flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> LAUNCH[Launch App]
    LAUNCH --> SPLASH[Splash Screen]
    SPLASH --> AUTHCHK{Signed in and<br/>activated?}

    AUTHCHK -->|Not signed in| WELCOME[Welcome Screen]
    AUTHCHK -->|Signed in, activated| HOME[Home / Dashboard]
    AUTHCHK -->|Signed in, blocked| PENDING[Consent Pending]

    WELCOME --> SIGNUP[Sign Up]
    WELCOME --> LOGIN[Login]

    SIGNUP --> CHECKMAIL[Check Your Email<br/>Firebase verification link]
    CHECKMAIL --> ONBOARD[Onboarding<br/>Grade, Interests, Avatar]
    ONBOARD --> MINOR{Under 18?}
    MINOR -->|No| HOME
    MINOR -->|Yes| CONSENT[Guardian Email Form]
    CONSENT --> PENDING
    PENDING -->|approved| HOME
    PENDING -->|sign out| WELCOME

    LOGIN --> HOME
    LOGIN --> FORGOT[Forgot Password]
    FORGOT --> RESETMAIL[Reset Link Sent<br/>learner resets in browser]
    RESETMAIL --> LOGIN

    HOME --> LEARN[Learn Tab<br/>Module List]
    HOME --> PROGRESS[Progress Tab<br/>Stats & Badges]
    HOME --> PROFILE[Profile Tab]

    LEARN --> MODDETAIL[Module Detail<br/>lesson list + lock state]
    MODDETAIL --> LESSON[Lesson View<br/>step by step]
    HOME --> LESSON

    LESSON --> CHALLENGE[Challenge]
    CHALLENGE --> BADGE[Badge Award<br/>one screen per badge]
    CHALLENGE --> LEVELUP[Level Up]
    BADGE --> LEVELUP
    BADGE --> RESULT
    LEVELUP --> RESULT[Result & Points]
    CHALLENGE --> RESULT
    RESULT --> HOME
    RESULT --> LESSON

    HOME --> HISTORY[Lesson History]
    PROGRESS --> HISTORY
    PROFILE --> HISTORY
    HISTORY --> LESSON
    HISTORY --> CHALLENGE

    PROFILE --> EDITPROF[Edit Profile]
    PROFILE --> SETTINGS[Settings]
    SETTINGS --> WELCOME
